Package: rconsoleai
Title: RConsoleAI - AI Chatbot for R and RStudio Console
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("RConsoleAI Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "rconsoleai@example.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: An AI chatbot that works directly inside the R and RStudio Console.
    Provides interactive chat sessions, code debugging, code explanation,
    dataset assistance, and code generation capabilities. Uses AI Horde as
    the default free provider with optional secure backend integration for
    additional providers. No local models or API keys required for basic usage.
